{"type":"text","timestamp":1794347167926,"sessionID":"ses_e38957fc2ffea5rGdpZf5rJULa","part":{"id":"prt_1c76cf0a50018G0HPA6hqiEo8E","messageID":"msg_1c76ce2520012fmrgByX9lFdwM","sessionID":"ses_e38957fc2ffea5rGdpZf5rJULa","type":"text","text":"<think>Two failures:\n\n1. `test_transfer_insufficient_funds`: bob's balance is 1250 instead of 1000 — because the test client shares a DB across tests (temp dir) and previous tests (test_transfer_moves_money) already transferred money to bob. The DB is shared between tests since I use a module-level temp dir. I should isolate each test with a fresh DB. Let me make the fixture drop/recreate the DB per test.\n\n2. Same cause for the listing test (alice sent 3 + bob→alice = 4... total 6? alice sees 3 sent + 1 received = 4, but got 6 — because previous test transfers also counted: test_transfer_moves_money (1) + test_transfer_without_memo (1) + 3 + 1 = 6 for alice. Yes, shared DB.\n\nFix: recreate the schema per test. In the fixture: delete DB file and re-init, or delete rows between tests. Simplest: in the fixture, close all connections, remove the DB files, and re-init_db.\n\nSince db.DATA_DIR/DB_PATH are module-level and the app uses db.get_db() → connect() uses DB_PATH. Let me add a helper in the fixture:\n\n```python\n@pytest.fixture()\ndef client():\n    app_module.app.config[\"TESTING\"] = True\n    for suffix in (\"\", \"-wal\", \"-shm\"):\n        p = Path(str(db.DB_PATH) + suffix)\n        if p.exists(): p.unlink()\n    db.init_db()\n    with app_module.app.test_client() as test_client:\n        yield test_client\n```\n\nBut careful: db.init_db() creates a connection; the per-request connections open the same path. Fine.\n\nWait, there's an ordering issue: db.DATA_DIR and DB_PATH are set at import time in the test module, but `connect()` uses the module-level DB_PATH — I reassign db.DB_PATH after import, and connect() reads the global at call time → ✓.\n\nLet me updatethe fixture.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794347167909,"end":1794347167924}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794347167964,"sessionID":"ses_e38957fc2ffea5rGdpZf5rJULa","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_01a1c76ceda874128ea4be7a","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/backend/tests/test_api.py","newString":"@pytest.fixture()\ndef client():\n    app_module.app.config[\"TESTING\"] = True\n    for suffix in (\"\", \"-wal\", \"-shm\"):\n        leftover = Path(str(db.DB_PATH) + suffix)\n        if leftover.exists():\n            leftover.unlink()\n    db.init_db()\n    with app_module.app.test_client() as test_client:\n        yield test_client","oldString":"@pytest.fixture()\ndef client():\n    app_module.app.config[\"TESTING\"] = True\n    with app_module.app.test_client() as test_client:\n        yield test_client"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /workspace/backend/tests/test_api.py\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/backend/tests/test_api.py\n+++ /workspace/backend/tests/test_api.py\n@@ -27,8 +27,13 @@\n \n @pytest.fixture()\n def client():\n     app_module.app.config[\"TESTING\"] = True\n+    for suffix in (\"\", \"-wal\", \"-shm\"):\n+        leftover = Path(str(db.DB_PATH) + suffix)\n+        if leftover.exists():\n+            leftover.unlink()\n+    db.init_db()\n     with app_module.app.test_client() as test_client:\n         yield test_client\n \n \n","filediff":{"file":"/workspace/backend/tests/test_api.py","patch":"Index: /workspace/backend/tests/test_api.py\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/backend/tests/test_api.py\n+++ /workspace/backend/tests/test_api.py\n@@ -27,8 +27,13 @@\n \n @pytest.fixture()\n def client():\n     app_module.app.config[\"TESTING\"] = True\n+    for suffix in (\"\", \"-wal\", \"-shm\"):\n+        leftover = Path(str(db.DB_PATH) + suffix)\n+        if leftover.exists():\n+            leftover.unlink()\n+    db.init_db()\n     with app_module.app.test_client() as test_client:\n         yield test_client\n \n \n","additions":5,"deletions":0},"truncated":false},"title":"backend/tests/test_api.py","time":{"start":1794347167920,"end":1794347167934}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c76cf0a8001T8jVWlHbAQKHPG","sessionID":"ses_e38957fc2ffea5rGdpZf5rJULa","messageID":"msg_1c76ce2520012fmrgByX9lFdwM"}}
