{"type":"text","timestamp":1794347518644,"sessionID":"ses_e38957fc2ffea5rGdpZf5rJULa","part":{"id":"prt_1c7724a9d001w5QsTsK3tBuF5T","messageID":"msg_1c772408b001Ebdyki7uY6UTf6","sessionID":"ses_e38957fc2ffea5rGdpZf5rJULa","type":"text","text":"<think>The API works end to end. Now let me check the frontend rendering. I can't use a browser easily... Let me check if there's a headless browser available (playwright/chromium). Probably not installed. Let me check quickly.\n\nActually, I can validate the frontend by checking the built HTML/JS and doing a basic sanity check with a DOM-less check. But visual verification would be better. Let me check if playwright or chromium is available.\n\nLet me check `which chromium google-chrome node_modules/.bin/playwright`.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794347518621,"end":1794347518637}}}
